messages.message:
Write a credit decision letter for an Indonesian bank. All monetary amounts are in Indonesian Rupiah (IDR) — format them with dot thousands separators, e.g. Rp 50.000.000.
- Applicant ID: ${workflow.input.applicantId}
- Applicant name: ${workflow.input.fullName}
- Requested amount (IDR): ${workflow.input.requestedAmount}
- Decision: ${workflow.variables.finalStatus}
- Internal credit score: ${score_ref.output.result.score}
- Product tier: ${workflow.variables.tier}
- Approved credit limit (IDR): ${workflow.variables.creditLimit}
- Interest rate (APR %): ${workflow.variables.interestRate}
- Key factors / reason codes: ${score_ref.output.result.reasonCodes}
Return only the letter in Markdown.
